## qf-hist2 | Quick-fire: history 2 | history | 0 | - | qf-hist
quiz 2 | Who was the first Roman emperor?
* Augustus
o Julius Caesar
o Nero
o Caligula
= Caesar was dictator but never emperor. Augustus ruled from 27 BC.
> Next

quiz 3 | The Magna Carta was sealed in…
* 1215
o 1066
o 1314
o 1588
= King John at Runnymede.
