quiz 3 | Which country gifted the Statue of Liberty to the USA?
* France
o Britain
o Spain
o Italy
= Dedicated in 1886.
> Next

quiz 3 | When did the Titanic sink?
* 1912
o 1905
o 1918
o 1921
= 15 April 1912, on its maiden voyage.
